    <briefdescription>
<para>Blob Storage Backend Interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Abstract interface for external blob storage backends. Implementations include: Filesystem, S3, Azure Blob, WebDAV (ActiveDirectory).</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: Implementations must be thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
